<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on SBC shares.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on SBC shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston, Zurich said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on SBC registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    425 CHF		   PREMIUM	12.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.60 CHF		  GEARING	9.13 PCT</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 31.JUL.97-18.SEP.98   PAYDATE	31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  420 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
